### Todo API Testing
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ============================================
### 2. GET ALL TODOS
### ============================================

### Get All Todos (Initial - should be empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos


### ============================================
### 3. CREATE TODOS
### ============================================

### Create Todo 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Learn TypeScript"
}

### Create Todo 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Build a REST API"
}

### Create Todo 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Write Unit Tests"
}


### ============================================
### 4. GET TODOS
### ============================================

### Get All Todos (After creation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos

### Save Todo ID from response and use it below
@todoId = mlbnkqgfoeosy930ddi

### Get Single Todo by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}


### ============================================
### 5. UPDATE TODOS
### ============================================

### Update Todo - Mark as Completed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "completed": true
}

### Update Todo - Change Title
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Learn TypeScript Advanced"
}

### Update Todo - Change Both Title and Completed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Completed Task",
  "completed": true
}


### ============================================
### 6. DELETE TODOS
### ============================================

### Delete a Todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}


### ============================================
### 7. ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### Error: Create Todo with Empty Title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": ""
}

### Error: Create Todo without Title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
}

### Error: Create Todo with Title Too Long (>500 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": ""
}

### Error: Get Non-existent Todo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/invalid-id

### Error: Update Non-existent Todo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/non-existent-id
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "completed": true
}

### Error: Delete Non-existent Todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/non-existent-id

### Error: Invalid Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invalid

### Error: Update Todo with Invalid Data Type (completed as string)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "completed": "yes"
}

### Error: Update Todo with Invalid Title Type
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": 123
}
